y file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/interfaces/io/test_export_ndjson_js_safe.py:1-18,37-46,85-95,169-178` — Preserve deterministic inexact timestamps, string wire form, exact digits, and import coercion. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/io/test_import_batch_resume.py:1-16,48-51,107-113` — Preserve commit-count expectation, chunk rollback/resume, and diagnostic retry behavior. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/queries/test_next_batch_behavior.py:251-264,289-296` — Preserve the ADR-backed invariant and one pipeline consequence. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/interfaces/io/test_export_ndjson_js_safe.py tests/interfaces/io/test_import_batch_resume.py tests/interfaces/queries/test_next_batch_behavior.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/interfaces/io/test_export_ndjson_js_safe.py",